0,"ps_ratio":6.6,"fcf_to_ev":4.06,"fcf_to_mcap":3.8,"liab_to_assets":37.6,"cash_to_assets":35.3,"current_ratio":6.75,"roe":-1.7,"roa":-1,"moat":{"ticker":"MP","period":"2026Q3","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"MP Materials 的產品為稀土，屬於大宗商品屬性，缺乏品牌溢價能力。其產品價格主要受市場供需影響，而非公司品牌或定價策略。雖然公司在北美稀土供應鏈中扮演關鍵角色，但這更多是地緣政治和供應鏈安全的需求，而非消費者對品牌的忠誠度或公司獨特的定價權。與消費品或服務業相比，MP Materials 在品牌定價方面幾乎沒有護城河可言，其營收和利潤波動性較大，易受外部市場因素影響。","comment_en":"MP Materials' products are rare earth elements, which are commodities with no brand premium capability. Product pricing is primarily influenced by market supply and demand, not by the company's brand or pricing strategy. While the company plays a crucial role in the North American rare earth supply chain, this is more driven by geopolitical and supply chain security needs than by consumer brand loyalty or unique pricing power. Compared to consumer goods or service industries, MP Materials has virtually no moat in brand pricing, leading to significant revenue and profit volatility susceptible to external market factors."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"MP Materials 的核心競爭力在於其芒廷帕斯（Mountain Pass）稀土礦的開採和加工能力，這涉及到複雜的採礦技術和環境法規的遵守。雖然沒有傳統意義上的專利壁壘，但其礦產資源的開採權和加工技術的經驗累積，以及符合嚴格環保標準的運營模式，構成了事實上的進入壁壘。尤其是在北美地區，擁有如此規模和技術的稀土生產商屈指可數。政府對關鍵礦產的支持和監管政策，也可能為公司提供一定的保護，但這並非堅不可摧的專利。","comment_en":"MP Materials' core competitiveness lies in its ability to mine and process rare earth elements at the Mountain Pass mine, involving complex mining techniques and compliance with environmental regulations. While there are no traditional patent barriers, its mining rights and accumulated processing expertise, along with an operational model that meets stringent environmental standards, form a de facto entry barrier. Especially in North America, few rare earth producers possess such scale and technology. Government support and regulatory policies for critical minerals may also offer some protection, but this is not an insurmountable patent moat."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"對於 MP Materials 的客戶而言，轉換供應商的成本相對較高，因為稀土的應用涉及複雜的產業鏈，包括汽車、風電、電子等。一旦客戶與 MP Materials 建立穩定的供應關係，並將其產品整合到自身生產流程中，尋找並驗證新的供應商需要時間、資源和技術投入。然而，這種轉換成本並非絕對，尤其是在全球供應鏈多元化的趨勢下，客戶仍可能尋求替代方案。因此，轉換成本提供了一定的黏性，但並非極高的壁壘。","comment_en":"For MP Materials' customers, the cost of switching suppliers is relatively high because rare earth applications are integrated into complex industrial chains, including automotive, wind power, and electronics. Once customers establish a stable supply relationship with MP Materials and integrate its products into their own production processes, finding and validating new suppliers requires time, resources, and technical investment. However, this switching cost is not absolute, especially with the global trend towards supply chain diversification, where customers may still seek alternative solutions. Therefore, switching costs provide some stickiness but are not an extremely high barrier."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"MP Materials 的業務模式，即稀土的開採和加工，本質上不具備網絡效應。其產品的價值在於稀有性、物理特性和供應穩定性，而非用戶之間的互動或平台效應。公司與客戶之間的關係更多是基於供應合約和產品規格，而非網絡效應驅動的用戶增長或價值提升。因此，在網絡效應這一維度上，MP Materials 幾乎沒有任何護城河可言，其業務發展不依賴於用戶數量的增加來創造額外價值。","comment_en":"MP Materials' business model, which involves mining and processing rare earth elements, inherently lacks network effects. The value of its products stems from their rarity, physical properties, and supply stability, rather than user interaction or platform effects. The relationship between the company and its customers is based more on supply contracts and product specifications, not on user growth or value enhancement driven by network effects. Therefore, in terms of network effects, MP Materials has virtually no moat, and its business development does not rely on increasing user numbers to create additional value."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"MP Materials 的芒廷帕斯礦是北美最大的稀土礦之一，其規模化運營帶來了顯著的成本優勢。大規模開採和加工能夠攤薄固定成本，提高生產效率，並在採購原材料和設備時獲得更好的議價能力。相較於其他小型或新進入者，MP Materials 在成本控制和生產效率方面具有明顯的優勢。這種規模經濟是稀土行業的重要壁壘，能夠幫助公司在市場競爭中保持有利地位，尤其是在價格波動時更能體現其韌性。","comment_en":"MP Materials' Mountain Pass mine is one of the largest rare earth mines in North America, and its scaled operations provide a significant cost advantage. Large-scale mining and processing can spread fixed costs, improve production efficiency, and enhance bargaining power when purchasing raw materials and equipment. Compared to smaller or new entrants, MP Materials has a clear advantage in cost control and production efficiency. This economies of scale is an important barrier in the rare earth industry, helping the company maintain a favorable position in market competition, especially demonstrating resilience during price fluctuations."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"MP Materials 擁有位於美國加州的芒廷帕斯稀土礦，這是北美地區唯一一個大規模、低成本運營的稀土礦。該礦產資源的稀缺性、地理位置的戰略重要性（靠近美國本土的製造業客戶），以及其已建立的開採和加工基礎設施，構成了極其獨特的資產壁壘。在全球稀土供應鏈高度集中於少數國家的背景下，MP Materials 的資產具有不可替代的戰略價值，這使其在供應鏈安全和地緣政治考量下，擁有了類似於「收費橋」的稀缺性與重要性。","comment_en":"MP Materials owns the Mountain Pass rare earth mine in California, USA, which is the only large-scale, low-cost operating rare earth mine in North America. The scarcity of this mineral resource, its strategic geographical location (close to US domestic manufacturing customers), and its established mining and processing infrastructure constitute an extremely unique asset barrier. Against the backdrop of a global rare earth supply chain highly concentrated in a few countries, MP Materials' asset possesses irreplaceable strategic value, giving it a scarcity and importance akin to a 'toll bridge' under supply chain security and geopolitical considerations."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"MP Materials 在芒廷帕斯礦的運營效率體現在其持續優化採礦和加工流程，以提高產出並降低成本。公司近年來在提升稀土分離能力和擴大產能方面取得了顯著進展，並致力於實現更環保的生產方式。儘管稀土行業的複雜性帶來挑戰，但 MP Materials 展現了其在管理複雜運營、應對環境法規以及提高生產效率方面的能力。其 FCF TTM 表現（$239.7M）也側面印證了其在當前市場環境下的營運效率。","comment_en":"MP Materials' operational efficiency at the Mountain Pass mine is reflected in its continuous optimization of mining and processing workflows to increase output and reduce costs. The company has made significant progress in recent years in enhancing rare earth separation capabilities and expanding production capacity, while also focusing on more environmentally friendly production methods. Despite the challenges posed by the complexity of the rare earth industry, MP Materials has demonstrated its ability to manage complex operations, navigate environmental regulations, and improve production efficiency. Its FCF TTM performance ($239.7M) also indirectly confirms its operational efficiency in the current market environment."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"MP Materials 的資本配置策略似乎聚焦於擴大產能、提升技術和償還債務。公司擁有相對健康的現金儲備（$1,337.9M）和較低的淨負債率（現金 $1,337.9M / 負債 $936.3M），這為其提供了靈活性。然而，其 ROE 和 ROA 數據為負，表明目前的資本回報效率不高。這可能與其處於擴張階段、行業週期性以及對未來投資的考量有關。管理層需要在擴張與盈利能力之間取得平衡，並確保資本配置能帶來長期可持續的回報。","comment_en":"MP Materials' capital allocation strategy appears focused on expanding production capacity, enhancing technology, and repaying debt. The company possesses a relatively healthy cash reserve ($1,337.9M) and a low net debt ratio (Cash $1,337.9M / Debt $936.3M), providing it with flexibility. However, its negative ROE and ROA figures indicate currently low capital return efficiency. This may be related to its expansion phase, industry cyclicality, and considerations for future investments. Management needs to balance expansion with profitability and ensure capital allocation yields long-term sustainable returns."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"MP Materials 的客戶主要是大型工業企業，其產品是關鍵的原材料。一旦客戶與 MP Materials 建立長期供應協議，並將其稀土產品整合到其生產鏈中，出於對供應穩定性和產品質量的考量，客戶通常會傾向於維持現有供應商。然而，由於稀土的商品屬性以及全球供應鏈的潛在變化，客戶並非完全沒有選擇。公司需要持續提供有競爭力的價格和可靠的供應，以維持客戶關係，但這種關係的黏性不如品牌忠誠度高的消費品。","comment_en":"MP Materials' customers are primarily large industrial enterprises, and its products are critical raw materials. Once customers establish long-term supply agreements with MP Materials and integrate its rare earth products into their production chains, they tend to maintain existing suppliers due to considerations of supply stability and product quality. However, due to the commodity nature of rare earths and potential shifts in the global supply chain, customers are not entirely without options. The company needs to continuously offer competitive pricing and reliable supply to maintain customer relationships, but the stickiness of these relationships is less than that of consumer goods with high brand loyalty."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"MP Materials 的業務具有一定的週期性，受全球經濟和特定行業（如汽車、新能源）需求波動的影響。然而，其核心資產——芒廷帕斯稀土礦，以及其在北美稀土供應鏈中的戰略地位，為其提供了長期的可持續性。隨著全球對關鍵礦產供應安全意識的提高，以及環保法規對新礦開發的限制，MP Materials 的獨特地理資產和運營能力，使其在未來幾十年內仍將保持其重要性。其業務模式類似於「商品型」企業，依賴於資源稟賦和規模化運營，具有一定的抗顛覆性。","comment_en":"MP Materials' business has a certain cyclicality, influenced by global economic fluctuations and demand shifts in specific industries (such as automotive and new energy). However, its core asset, the Mountain Pass rare earth mine, and its strategic position in the North American rare earth supply chain provide long-term sustainability. With increasing global awareness of critical mineral supply security and restrictions on new mine development due to environmental regulations, MP Materials' unique geographical assets and operational capabilities will ensure its importance for decades to come. Its business model is akin to a 'commodity' business, relying on resource endowment and scaled operations, possessing a degree of resilience against disruption."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"MP Materials 的護城河主要體現在其獨特的地理資產（M6），即北美唯一的規模化稀土礦，這賦予了其類似「收費橋」的戰略價值和稀缺性。規模經濟（M5）也提供了顯著的成本優勢。然而，其產品的大宗商品屬性限制了品牌定價權（M1），網絡效應（M4）幾乎為零。轉換成本（M3）和客戶關係（M9）提供了一定的黏性，但並非堅固壁壘。運營效率（M7）和資本配置（M8）尚可，但回報率有待提升。總體而言，MP Materials 是一家依賴稀缺資源和規模化運營的「商品型」企業，其護城河相對堅固，但易受週期性波動影響，且缺乏強大的品牌或網絡效應。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"MP Materials' moat is primarily reflected in its unique geographical asset (M6), the only scaled rare earth mine in North America, which grants it strategic value and scarcity akin to a 'toll bridge'. Economies of scale (M5) also provide a significant cost advantage. However, the commodity nature of its products limits brand pricing power (M1), and network effects (M4) are virtually non-existent. Switching costs (M3) and customer relationships (M9) offer some stickiness but are not robust barriers. Operational efficiency (M7) and capital allocation (M8) are adequate, but returns need improvement. Overall, MP Materials is a 'commodity' business reliant on scarce resources and scaled operations, possessing a relatively solid moat but susceptible to cyclical fluctuations and lacking strong brand or network effects.","evidenceHash":"8789279a6cd7ce3ddfe758798605417dd4a12b7fb1ee416ca5e56394250db715","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null,"evidenceHash":"8789279a6cd7ce3ddfe758798605417dd4a12b7fb1ee416ca5e56394250db715","currentEvidenceHash":"8789279a6cd7ce3ddfe758798605417dd4a12b7fb1ee416ca5e56394250db715"},"fScore":{"score":5,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"grey","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-08T07:58:01.383Z","evidenceHash":"16c9d404ee4e6b3abb5b86d36c721043bd5d3f518eccdbe161a1d94878cf57c4"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"highRisk","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-08T07:58:01.383Z","evidenceHash":"16c9d404ee4e6b3abb5b86d36c721043bd5d3f518eccdbe161a1d94878cf57c4"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/MP.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/MP.png","website":"https://mpmaterials.com","ceo":"James Henry Litinsky","full_time_employees":"998","description":"MP Materials Corp. manages and operates facilities dedicated to the extraction and refinement of rare earth elements. The company's primary asset is the Mountain Pass Rare Earth mine, a key operation situated within the Western Hemisphere. MP Materials holds comprehensive mineral rights for this significant deposit and its surrounding areas, alongside proprietary intellectual property essential for the ongoing processing and technological development of rare earth minerals. Its product offerings include critical elements such as cerium, lanthanum, neodymium, praseodymium, and samarium. Established in 2017, the company is headquartered in Las Vegas, Nevada.","description_en":"MP Materials Corp. manages and operates facilities dedicated to the extraction and refinement of rare earth elements. The company's primary asset is the Mountain Pass Rare Earth mine, a key operation situated within the Western Hemisphere. MP Materials holds comprehensive mineral rights for this significant deposit and its surrounding areas, alongside proprietary intellectual property essential for the ongoing processing and technological development of rare earth minerals. Its product offerings include critical elements such as cerium, lanthanum, neodymium, praseodymium, and samarium. Established in 2017, the company is headquartered in Las Vegas, Nevada.","description_zh":"MP Materials Corp.（美股代碼：MP）為 Basic Materials 領域之重要企業，專注於 Industrial Materials 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"1700 S. Pavilion Center Drive","city":"Las Vegas","state":"NV","zip":"89135","country":"US","phone":"702 844 6111","full_address":"1700 S. Pavilion Center Drive, Las Vegas, NV 89135, US","range_52w":"31.9-76.8","year_high":76.8,"year_low":31.9,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":31.9,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-10-13","name":"Infuso David Gregory","title":"officer: Chief Accounting Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"F-InKind",